  "preText": "Music's on again along with some chants and singing",
  "text": "<strong>Broad nicks off Boland!</strong> Bluffed with the short-ball field. Full ball outside off at 83mph. Boland, like Steven Smith, goes for the cover drive. Gets a thin edge, regulation catch for Bairstow. Broad's off runnin', fielders converge in celebration. The noise level goes up from the crowd",
  "postText": "Duncan: \"England would never admit it...but bet they would have liked to keep Boland around for a bit longer to keep the scoring low to ramp up the pressure.\" Boland batted for 35 minutes under tough conditions and kept Broad and Anderson at bay. While more runs runs would've been great, weathering the storm ain't all that bad",
  "shortText": "Broad to Boland, OUT",
